{"last_link_id": 14, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["参考音频文案，要求一样！"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 88], "pos": [-2554.703369140625, -578.2223510742188], "id": 9, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["提示词"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 88], "pos": [-2562.2197265625, -854.30224609375], "id": 10, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "Generated Audio", "links": [10], "label": "Generated Audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "Generated Audio"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["VoxCPM1.5", "哎呀，大师兄，不好咯！师父又遭妖怪抓起跑咯！这回是哪个批妖孽哦，黑黢黢的一坨，扛着师父‘嗖’一下就没得影儿咯！我追得屁儿翻天，结果一跟头栽到田头，啃了一嘴泥巴！师父在那儿喊：‘八戒救我！’我救个铲铲哦，我自身都难保！你还不赶紧翻你的筋斗云，拿你的金箍棒，去给他两坨子！再慢点，师父就要被蒸起、煮起、红烧起咯！老子肚皮都饿扁咯，还等你打妖妖，打完回去吃斋饭！快点儿哦，猴哥，我屁儿都冒烟咯！", 2, 10, true, 779450847354055, "fixed", false, "cuda", 3, 6, ""], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "prompt_audio", "link": 12, "label": "prompt_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "prompt_audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 14, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg_value"}, "name": "cfg_value", "label": "cfg_value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg_value"}, {"widget": {"name": "inference_timesteps"}, "name": "inference_timesteps", "label": "inference_timesteps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "inference_timesteps"}, {"widget": {"name": "normalize_text"}, "name": "normalize_text", "label": "normalize_text", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "normalize_text"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "force_offload"}, "name": "force_offload", "label": "force_offload", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "force_offload"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}, {"widget": {"name": "retry_max_attempts"}, "name": "retry_max_attempts", "label": "retry_max_attempts", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "retry_max_attempts"}, {"widget": {"name": "retry_threshold"}, "name": "retry_threshold", "label": "retry_threshold", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "retry_threshold"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_text"}, "shape": 7, "name": "prompt_text", "link": 13, "label": "prompt_text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "VoxCPM_TTS", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [399.0082702636719, 621.6956176757812], "pos": [-1438.1444091796875, -1058.956787109375], "id": 5, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VoxCPM_TTS"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["audio/VoxCPM"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 10, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveAudio", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [457.93402099609375, 232.27186584472656], "pos": [-998.1849975585938, -1062.38330078125], "id": 1, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.52", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"filename_prefix": true, "audioUI": true}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudio", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#533", "groupcolor": "#A88", "color": "#322"}}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["# ComfyUI-VoxCPM\n\n**VoxCPM**  a novel tokenizer-free TTS system for context-aware speech generation and true-to-life voice cloning.\n\n## Models\nThis node automatically downloads the required model files.\n\n| Model | Parameters | Hugging Face Link |\n|:---|:---:|:---|\n| VoxCPM-0.5B | 0.5B | [openbmb/VoxCPM-0.5B](https://huggingface.co/openbmb/VoxCPM-0.5B) |\n\n## Support \n\n- Don't know how to update PyTorch?\n- Need help with ComfyUI?\n- Need technical support?\n\n### Or do you just have questions? Then join the [@TokenDiffusion Hub](https://t.me/TokenDiff_hub) group\n\n### AI news [TokenDiffusion](https://t.me/TokenDiff)"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [311.074462890625, 346.9256286621094], "pos": [-940.2899169921875, -714.1687622070312], "id": 4, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["## 🎤 Achieving High-Quality Voice Clones\n\nTo achieve the best voice cloning results, providing an accurate `prompt_text` is **critical**. This text acts as a transcript that aligns the sound of the `prompt_audio` with the words being spoken, teaching the model the speaker's unique vocal characteristics.\n\n### How to Use `prompt_text` Effectively\n\n#### 1. **Provide a Verbatim Transcript**\nThe `prompt_text` must be a word-for-word transcript of the `prompt_audio`. Do not summarize or describe the audio.\n\n✅ **Correct:** `The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.`\n\n❌ **Incorrect:** `A person saying a sentence about a fox.`\n\n#### 2. **Punctuation is Important**\nUse accurate punctuation to capture the speaker's intonation. The model learns how the speaker ends sentences, asks questions, or shows excitement.\n\n-   **For a statement:** `This is a great example.`\n-   **For a question:** `Is this a great example?`\n-   **For excitement:** `This is a great example!`\n\n#### 3. **Match Audio and Text Length**\nThe audio clip should be long enough to capture the speaker's natural pacing and rhythm.\n\n👍 **Good:** A 5-15 second clip of continuous, clear speech.\n\n👌 **Okay:** A 3-5 second clip.\n\n⚠️ **Warning:** Very short clips (< 3 seconds) may result in a less stable or robotic-sounding clone.\n\n\n> **Note:**\n> For the best results, use a clean, high-quality `prompt_audio` with minimal background noise, reverb, or music. The model will try to clone the *entire* acoustic environment, not just the voice."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [360.7866516113281, 348.9750061035156], "pos": [-1854.4808349609375, -1096.801513671875], "id": 6, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [12], "label": "AUDIO", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "AUDIO"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["9e40ce3b181023908244a32163688b3f18cf0b03be887b0252beb02033fb0b9f.wav", null, null], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "audio"}, "name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "AUDIOUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadAudio", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [350.4437255859375, 136], "pos": [-2251.99462890625, -1132.56103515625], "id": 2, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.52", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"upload": true, "audio": true, "audioUI": true}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadAudio", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#533", "groupcolor": "#A88", "color": "#322"}}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [13], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_valu